# Git LFS：媒体与打包产物走 LFS，避免仓库膨胀
# 只覆盖 docs/ 下的交付物、端到端证据与竞赛材料：仓库其余路径（如 ui/public 的既有 PNG）
# 早于 LFS 引入就以普通 blob 入库，全局扩展名匹配会与它们冲突，使 git lfs fsck 报
# unexpectedGitObject、并让这些路径在新 worktree 里永远显示为 modified。
docs/**/*.mp4  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.pptx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.pdf  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.zip  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.rar  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.jpg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/**/*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/deliverables/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/e2e/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
